1
00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:04,322
Second: the period grows as the square root of the length.

2
00:00:04,322 --> 00:00:08,763
Make the string four times longer, and the period only doubles.

3
00:00:08,763 --> 00:00:09,687
Count with me.

4
00:00:09,687 --> 00:00:15,104
The short pendulum swings twice, for every single swing of the long one.

